description = "Riverhorse is a PlayStation emulator focused on accuracy, with fast software and hardware renderers (OpenGL, OpenGL ES and Vulkan), PGXP geometry correction, upscaling and a dynamic recompiler (x86-64, AArch64, ARMv7). A BIOS image is required to start the emulator and to play games."
